<workout_file>
    <author>Coach Library</author>
    <name>VO2max L10B - Ramped 6x4 (110 to 125)</name>
    <description>VO2max - level 10 of 10, variant B. Ramped 6x4 (110 to 125).

Structure: 10 min warm-up, 4 min ramp 110% to 125%, 3 min @ 50%, 4 min ramp 110% to 125%, 3 min @ 50%, 4 min ramp 110% to 125%, 3 min @ 50%, 4 min ramp 110% to 125%, 3 min @ 50%, 4 min ramp 110% to 125%, 3 min @ 50%, 4 min ramp 110% to 125%, 5 min @ 60%, 6 min cool-down.

Coach notes: Each interval ramps from 110% to 125%: it finishes at its hardest. Mentally prepare for the final minute.

Estimated TSS: 73.</description>
    <sportType>bike</sportType>
    <tags>
        <tag name="VO2max"/>
        <tag name="Level 10"/>
    </tags>
